# Cloud Agent Environment Setup

When configuring a Cursor Cloud environment for this Terraform stack, install
exactly the tooling below and nothing more. Do not invent extra config (no
`mise` setup unless a `mise.toml` exists, no `environment.json`, no Dockerfile).

## Required tools

- `terraform` (>= 1.0)
- `just`
- `aws` (AWS CLI v2)
- `terraform-docs`
- `jq`

## Verify (offline, no AWS account)

`just init`, `just validate`, and `terraform fmt -check -recursive`.
(`just plan` / `just apply` need real AWS credentials plus a pre-existing VPC,
DB subnet group, and security groups, so they can't run during setup.)
